							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<div style="overflow: auto; width: 100%;">the show was dope.  ra rocked it.  (RAcked it?)  sure as hell didn&#039;t fail expectations after last years ill performance.  ab creole rocked it.  it was probably everyone&#039;s first time seeing them.  they were fuckin&#039; dope.  i love their vibe.  the freestyle session was fun as hell.  it might&#039;ve been kinda&#039; weak that josh boots closed after the headliners - and he&#039;s not local, he&#039;s from anchorage  <img src="http://masslinemedia.com/smf/Smileys/default/wink.gif" alt="Wink" border="0" /> -  but i heard he was delayed due to a family death, so it says a lot that he honored the commitment just to come.  <br /><br />the whole festival was dope as hell.  lots of love.  and the salmon crepes were spectacular!  </div>
						</td>
					</tr>
