									<img src="http://masslinemedia.com/smf/Themes/safgrey105/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" />
									Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<div style="overflow: auto; width: 100%; padding-bottom: 3px;" class="signature">&quot;Will affection be the next step in human evolution class, <br />or will attention be spent in perfectin&#039; a weapon&#039;s fusion blast?&quot; - micelph</div>
